_:N2501ad1dd52c4b20911c77f2c82958f9 a csvw:Column ;
    dct:description "Choose a format for the code list:"@en ;
    dct:isPartOf "code_list" ;
    dct:type "radio" ;
    skos:notation "1 = List of codes separated by pipe character",
        "3 = CSV file upload with codes in column 1 and labels in column 2." ;
    csvw:datatype "integer" ;
    csvw:name "code_format" ;
    csvw:title "Choose a format for the code list:"@en .

_:N26a9254c73fb41eebd2d441a571ce2ca a csvw:Column ;
    dct:description """Code list
Format is "1 = Chocolate | 2 = Strawberry | 3 = Vanilla".
The Pipe character is required between codes because line breaks will be lost if the data dictionary (CSV) is used to update this field."""@en ;
    dct:isPartOf "code_list" ;
    dct:type "notes" ;
    csvw:datatype "string" ;
    csvw:name "code_list" ;
    csvw:title """Code list
Format is "1 = Chocolate | 2 = Strawberry | 3 = Vanilla".
The Pipe character is required between codes because line breaks will be lost if the data dictionary (CSV) is used to update this field."""@en .

